DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nVicki Barbolak LIVE at Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\
	nAmerica’s Got Talent fan favorite Vicki Barbolak brings her hilarious Tra
	iler Park Happy Hour show to Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club at the LINQ on the
	 Las Vegas Strip on July 15\, 2026. Known for her outrageous humor and lov
	able personality\, Vicki delivers a night of laughs you won’t forget. \nEv
	ent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 15\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PT\nVenue: Ji
	mmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 
	89109 (at the LINQ)\nAge Requirement: 18+ (except Farrell Dillon shows whi
	ch are all ages)\nParking: Available at Harrah’s\, Flamingo\, LINQ\, and s
	urface lots \nAbout Vicki Barbolak\nVicki Barbolak is a Top 10 finalist an
	d fan favorite from NBC’s America’s Got Talent\, where Simon Cowell called
	 her “the best comedian we’ve had on this show.” She’s a member of Jay Len
	o’s NBC Laugh Squad\, won Funniest Mom in America on Nick@Nite\, and hosts
	 the hit podcast Trailer Park Diaries produced by Bill Burr. Her comedy is
	 bold\, warm\, and wildly funny. \nWhat to Expect\n\nVicki Barbolak’s sign
	ature Trailer Park Happy Hour show\nBold\, outrageous stand-up comedy\n18+
	 show at Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club on the Strip\nAs seen on America’s Got
	 Talent and America’s Got Talent: The Champions\nIntimate venue with great
	 sightlines\nUp to 3 hours free parking for locals nearby\n\nVenue Informa
	tion\nJimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club is located at the LINQ Promenade on the L
	as Vegas Strip\, offering an intimate 18+ comedy experience with top natio
	nal headliners nightly. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $62. This
	 event has a 20-ticket limit. Must be 18+ to attend. \nOfficial Tickets\nR
	esale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission i
	f you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sa
	les are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be require
	d for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/vicki-barbolak-live-at-ji
	mmy-kimmels-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/vicki-barbolak-live-at-jimmy-kimmels-c
	omedy-club/
LOCATION:Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\, 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, N
	V\, 89109\, USA
