	ckets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nGabriel Iglesias: Flu
	ffy’s 50th Birthday Show LIVE at Dolby Theatre\nGabriel “Fluffy” Iglesias 
	is celebrating his 50th birthday in the most fitting way possible — with a
	 live comedy show at the iconic Dolby Theatre in Hollywood. \nAll tickets 
	are priced at a flat $50 for this one-night-only birthday celebration on h
	is actual birthday\, July 15\, 2026. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, Ju
	ly 15\, 2026 \nTime: 8:00 PM PDT \nVenue: Dolby Theatre \nAddress: 6801 Ho
	llywood Blvd\, Hollywood\, CA 90028 \nAge Requirement: All ages welcome \n
	About Gabriel Iglesias\nGabriel Iglesias\, known worldwide as “Fluffy\,” i
	s one of the most successful stand-up comedians in the world. He has sold 
	out arenas across the globe and starred in multiple Netflix specials\, inc
	luding One Show Fits All and Stadium Fluffy. \nKnown for his high-energy s
	torytelling\, hilarious character voices\, and relatable humor\, Fluffy ha
	s built a massive fanbase spanning generations. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA one-
	night-only 50th birthday celebration with Gabriel Iglesias\nHilarious stan
	d-up comedy featuring Fluffy’s signature storytelling style\nSpecial birth
	day surprises and moments throughout the show\nAn intimate evening at the 
	legendary Dolby Theatre in Hollywood\nFlat $50 all-in ticket pricing — a r
	are deal for a major comedy event\n\nVenue Information\nThe Dolby Theatre 
	is one of Hollywood’s most prestigious venues\, located at 6801 Hollywood 
	Blvd. Home to the Academy Awards\, it offers world-class acoustics and an 
	unforgettable atmosphere for live performances. \nTicket Information\nAll 
	tickets are $50 (all-in pricing). This is a special flat-rate birthday sho
	w — no tiered pricing. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets 
	(VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if
