	vice available throughout the evening. The venue is conveniently located n
	ear downtown San Jose parking garages and is accessible via public transit
	. The mandatory two-item minimum ensures every guest enjoys a complete din
	ner-and-show experience. \nWhat to Expect\nChinedu Unaka is celebrated for
	 his smooth\, conversational delivery and his ability to connect with audi
	ences through relatable\, observational humor. \nExpect a night of sharp\,
	 engaging stand-up that blends personal storytelling with clever social co
	mmentary. Chinedu’s background as a former teacher gives his comedy a uniq
	ue warmth and intelligence — he knows how to read a room and keep the ener
	gy high from start to finish. \nThis is a 21+ event in an intimate club se
	tting\, perfect for a date night or a fun evening out with friends. Arrive
	 early to grab the best seats\, as seating is general admission. \nTicket 
	Information\nTickets for Chinedu Unaka at San Jose Improv start at $25 (GA
	)\, with Premium Banquette options available up to $75 per ticket (includi
