SUMMARY:Kiki Yeung & Esther Ku: Sweet and Sour Chicks LIVE at San Jose Impr
	ov
DTSTAMP:20260715T051906Z
DTSTART:20260716T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout Kiki Yeung & Esther K
	u\nKiki Yeung and Esther Ku are two powerhouse Asian-American stand-up com
	edians joining forces for their hilarious Sweet and Sour Chicks tour. Both
	 comedians have built devoted followings through their fearless\, boundary
	-pushing comedy that tackles identity\, culture\, relationships\, and the 
	absurdities of everyday life. \nEsther Ku is known for her bold\, unapolog
	etic humor and has appeared on Comedy Central and numerous national stages
	. Kiki Yeung brings sharp wit and relatable storytelling to the stage\, ea
	rning acclaim for her unique perspective as an Asian-American woman in com
	edy. Together\, they deliver a dynamic double-bill that is both hilarious 
	and refreshingly honest. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, July 16\, 202
	6\nTime: 8:00 PM (doors open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: San Jose Improv\, 62 S Se
	cond St\, San Jose\, CA 95113\nNote: This is a special one-night-only even
	t\nAge Restriction: 21+ (valid photo ID required)\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe 
	San Jose Improv is the Bay Area’s go-to comedy destination\, nestled in th
	e heart of downtown San Jose. This intimate club-style venue holds approxi
	mately 250 guests and is part of the iconic Improv comedy club chain that 
	has launched the careers of countless comedy legends. \nThe venue offers a
	 full bar and food menu\, comfortable seating with excellent sightlines\, 
	and a lively atmosphere that makes every show feel like a special event. C
	onveniently located near downtown parking garages and public transit\, it’
	s easy to make a full night out of your visit. \nWhat to Expect\nThe Sweet
	 and Sour Chicks show is a high-energy double-bill featuring both Kiki Yeu
	ng and Esther Ku performing their best material back-to-back. Expect sharp
	 cultural commentary\, personal storytelling\, and plenty of laughs as the
	se two comedians play off each other’s energy. \nThis is a rare opportunit
	y to see two of the most exciting voices in Asian-American comedy on the s
	ame stage in an intimate setting. The show runs approximately 90 minutes a
	nd is not to be missed. \nTicket Information\nTickets are priced at approx
	imately $30 – $60 depending on seating and availability. \n\nOfficial Tick
	ets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commi
	ssion if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \
	nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be 
	required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/kiki-yeung-esther-
	ku-sweet-and-sour-chicks-live-at-san-jose-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/kiki-yeung-esther-ku-sweet-and-sour-ch
	icks-live-at-san-jose-improv/
LOCATION:San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, California\, 95113\,
	 United States
