SUMMARY:Rodney Carrington LIVE at Turfway Park
DTSTAMP:20260715T051906Z
DTSTART:20260717T210000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nRodney Ca
	rrington is a multi-talented comedian\, actor\, and country music artist w
	ho has been making audiences laugh for over two decades. Known for his out
	rageous\, adult-oriented humor and his ability to blend stand-up comedy wi
	th live musical performances\, Rodney has built one of the most loyal fanb
	ases in the comedy world. \nHis comedy albums have gone platinum\, his TV 
	series Rodney ran on ABC\, and his live shows are legendary for their high
	 energy\, crowd interaction\, and the kind of no-holds-barred humor that k
	eeps fans coming back year after year. Rodney’s unique style — part stand-
	up\, part musical comedy — makes every show a one-of-a-kind experience. \n
	Whether he’s strumming his guitar or delivering rapid-fire punchlines\, Ro
	dney Carrington delivers an evening of pure\, unfiltered entertainment tha
	t leaves audiences in tears of laughter. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\,
	 July 17\, 2026\nTime: 9:00 PM\nVenue: Turfway Park\, 7500 Turfway Road\, 
	Florence\, KY 41042\nAge Restrictions: Ages 21 & over only\nTicket Price R
	ange: $84 – $150\n\nAbout the Venue\nTurfway Park is a premier entertainme
	nt and racing destination located in Florence\, Kentucky\, just south of C
	incinnati. The venue offers a unique outdoor concert and event experience 
	set against the backdrop of one of the region’s most storied horse racing 
	facilities. \nLocated at 7500 Turfway Road in Florence\, KY\, the venue is
	 easily accessible from both Louisville and Cincinnati\, making it a great
	 destination for fans from across the region. The outdoor setting creates 
	a lively\, festive atmosphere perfect for a late-night comedy show. \nAmpl
	e parking is available on-site at Turfway Park. Please note this is a 21+ 
	event — valid photo ID is required for entry. Dress comfortably for an out
	door summer evening show. \nWhat to Expect\nRodney Carrington delivers a h
	igh-energy\, adults-only stand-up and musical comedy performance. This is 
	a full headline show featuring Rodney’s signature blend of raunchy humor\,
	 country music\, and crowd-pleasing entertainment. \nExpect plenty of audi
	ence interaction\, live guitar performances\, and the kind of outrageous c
	omedy that has made Rodney one of the most beloved performers on the touri
	ng circuit. This is a late-night show — perfect for a summer Friday night 
	out with friends. \nDoors typically open before showtime. Arrive early to 
	grab drinks and find your spot before Rodney takes the stage for an unforg
	ettable evening of comedy and music. \nTicket Information\nTickets range f
	rom $84 to $150 depending on seat location. Purchase official tickets thro
	ugh Ticketmaster or find resale tickets through VividSeats. Must be 21+ to
	 attend. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedyc
	alendar.com/event/rodney-carrington-live-at-turfway-park/\n\nFrom Comedy C
	alendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/rodney-carrington-live-at-turfway-park
	/
